00:02:37.563 --> 00:02:39.147
<v Host>It means a baby.

00:02:39.747 --> 00:02:51.651
<v Slow>そして7月13日から、「ペンギンベース」という場所で、赤ちゃんの一般公開が始まりました。

00:02:52.451 --> 00:02:58.836
<v Host>And from July thirteenth, at a spot called Penguin Base, the baby went on public display.

00:02:59.436 --> 00:03:02.436
<v Vocab>一般公開

00:03:02.836 --> 00:03:06.388
<v Host>It means opening something up so the general public can see it.

00:03:06.987 --> 00:03:19.804
<v Slow>オウサマペンギンは、世界で2番目に大きいペンギンです。頭と胸のオレンジ色の模様が特徴です。

00:03:20.604 --> 00:03:28.596
<v Host>The king penguin is the second-largest penguin in the world. The orange markings on its head and chest are a distinctive feature.

00:03:29.195 --> 00:03:31.572
