00:03:52.092 --> 00:04:00.036
<v Host>At birth, the baby weighed about two hundred thirty-one grams. It is still small and wrapped in fluffy brown feathers.

00:04:00.635 --> 00:04:02.771
<v Vocab>重さ

00:04:03.171 --> 00:04:04.635
<v Host>It means weight.

00:04:05.235 --> 00:04:15.099
<v Slow>今は、飼育員が人の手でごはんをあげて、赤ちゃんを大切に育てています。

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:21.444
<v Host>For now, the keepers are feeding the baby by hand and raising it with great care.

