<v Vocab>体重

00:04:49.899 --> 00:04:51.555
<v Host>It means body weight.

00:04:52.156 --> 00:05:03.843
<v Slow>アドベンチャーワールドは、オウサマペンギンを約100羽飼っていて、その数は日本でいちばん多いそうです。

00:05:04.644 --> 00:05:11.651
<v Host>Adventure World keeps about one hundred king penguins, and that number is said to be the largest in Japan.

00:05:12.252 --> 00:05:14.291
<v Vocab>数

00:05:14.692 --> 00:05:17.620
<v Host>It means a number, or how many there are.

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:29.139
<v Slow>今、ほかにも3つの卵を温めていて、この夏、あと3羽くらい生まれる予定です。

00:05:29.939 --> 00:05:36.444
<v Host>Right now, three more eggs are being kept warm, and about three more chicks are expected to hatch this summer.

