00:07:08.959 --> 00:07:19.160
<v News>今、ほかにも3つの卵を温めていて、この夏、あと3羽くらい生まれる予定です。

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:28.668
<v News>小さくてかわいいペンギンの赤ちゃん。元気に大きくなってほしいですね。

00:07:29.367 --> 00:07:33.399
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:40.336
<v Slow>オウサマペンギンの赤ちゃんは、どこで生まれましたか。

00:07:41.136 --> 00:07:45.624
<v Host>At the theme park Adventure World, in Wakayama Prefecture.

00:07:46.223 --> 00:07:52.584
<v Slow>赤ちゃんが生まれたときの重さは、どれくらいでしたか。

00:07:53.384 --> 00:07:56.120
<v Host>About two hundred thirty-one grams.

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:04.136
<v Slow>アドベンチャーワールドには、オウサマペンギンが何羽くらいいますか。

00:08:04.935 --> 00:08:08.824
<v Host>About one hundred — the most of any place in Japan.

00:08:09.423 --> 00:08:36.087
<v Host>That's all for today. A baby king penguin was born at Adventure World in Wakayama on July eleventh and went on display two days later. It weighed only about two hundred thirty-one grams at birth, so keepers are feeding it by hand until it grows a little bigger. The park has around one hundred king penguins, the most in Japan, and three more chicks are expected this summer. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:08:36.687 --> 00:08:39.087
<v News>また明日。
